    "id": "pilot7-overlap",
    "language": "[0]So, in this scenario, um, (smacks lips) you are being blocked by a defender, and as your teammate, I do not have a defender on me. Um, so I want to get open for you so that you can pass me the ball, um, and we can get past the defender and score a goal. So, I will open up to the left of you, here, um, because the defender is not between where I'm going to open up to and where you are currently, so you should be able to pass me the ball. [1](wind blowing)[2] As I'm moving, you should [3]pass me the ball. And now I[4] have received the ball. Um, but in the meantime, the [5]defender got between me and the goal. Um, so, therefore, I will pass you the ball, um, so that you can hopefully make an attempt to go to the goal. [6](wind blowing)[7][8][9]",
